Big Mouth is a card added in '''Beta 6.6''', along with 19 others. Its first change was during '''Beta 7.1''', where its cost dropped from 6G to 5G. After a long time, '''Beta 40.0''' dropped its HP from 7 to 6 (just like [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Nurse_Mouth Nurse Mouth]'s) and reworked its effect. Originally, whenever an enemy monster with a cost of 0-2G was summoned, Big Mouth would kill it instantly and full restore itself.
[[File:Big Mouth (Beta 40.0).png|thumb|245x245px|Beta 40.0]]
Now, this will only trigger at the start and end of its owner's turn. And not only will it just be a single random <= 2G monster, it can also choose one of yours. '''Beta 52.1''' removed its Turn start trigger, while also no longer being able to kill one of your own <= 2G monsters. However, it no longer heals itself when it kills. Instead, you restore 2 HP.

=== Stats ===
