** to fully restore itself. (Post Beta 6.6)
* Turn start & Turn end: Kill a random <= 2G monster ...
** to fully restore itself. (Post Beta 40.0)
* Turn end: Kill a random enemy <= 2G monster ...
** to restore 2 HP to you. (Post Beta 52.1, Current)

Rarity: Blue (Rare)
